### Summary of semantics

| Scenario | prefix_mode | Result |
|---|---|---|
| No flag, 1 file | 0 | no prefix |
| No flag, ≥2 files | 0 | prefix with operand name |
| No flag, stdin | 0 | no prefix |
| `-H` (or `--with-filename`) | 1 | prefix always (one file, ≥2 files, stdin) |
| `-h` (or `--no-filename`) | 2 | no prefix ever |
| `-H -h` | 2 (last wins) | no prefix |
| `-h -H` | 1 (last wins) | prefix always |
| `-Hh` (cluster) | 2 (last char wins) | no prefix |
| `-hH` (cluster) | 1 (last char wins) | prefix always |

